ll one during a match and  take to the skies for quick flight and  to be honest the cloud is what pushed me  to finally update my game  when can i sell my car and get one of  these but as cool as all that dragon  ball stuff is when you need a break you  can check out the next wave of xbox game  pass titles eight games in total are  headed to the service before the month  is out unless xbox wants to surprise us  with some additional games as august  progresses out today is the coffee  brewing conversation game coffee talk in  which players brew coffee and then talk  to people about their issues the game is  available across console pc and cloud on  august 23rd midnight fight express comes  to game pass as a day 1 new release this  is a brutal and hyperkinetic brawler  that will be available on console pc and  cloud i really enjoyed my time with the  demo so i'm very excited to get my hands  on the full thing after that game pass  will add the open-ended puzzle game  exa-punks for pc on august 25th while  opus echo of star song full bloom  edition hits game pass for pc that day  as well the next day 1 new release for  game pass is commando 3 hd remaster a  high definition remaster of the tactics  game originally released in 2003 another  day one release is immortality the next  game from her story designer sam barlow  which releases on august 30th for pc  console and cloud also on the 30th is  ubisoft's adventure game immortals  phoenix rising and puzzle platformer  tinykin unfortunately though august 31st  will see a sizeable chunk of games exit  the service so if you haven't played  space-faring sim elite dangerous the  award-winning roguelite hades or the  satisfyingly grisly zombie shooter world  war z you only have a few days left to  do so you can also expect to say goodbye  to two point hospital but seeing how its  successor two point campus was recently  added to game pass it won't be too  bittersweet of a farewell but okay now  i'm gonna need you to hit the comment  section and let me know your favorite  dragon ball character growing up mine  was trunks  is that cool  or is it really lame that i liked trunks  and i still kind of see his character  sometimes and i think he's cool  he's badass  let me know i'll see you tomorrow
 

